<title>USA: BankAmerica bought back 2.5 mln shrs in Q3.</title>
<headline>BankAmerica bought back 2.5 mln shrs in Q3.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>BankAmerica Corp said Wednesday it repurchased 2.5 million shares of its common stock in the third quarter.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement it paid an average price of $78.48 a share, reducing stockholders equity by $200 million. Remaining buyback authority for common stock under the current program totaled $1.3 billion on September 30.</p>
<p>At the end of September, the bank holding company had 365.7 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
